{"body":{"says":"A mark the author drew between parts of one utterance, as ---- or **: not a divider but landscape, making space between what it parts, or by its absence clustering what it leaves together. Words across a mark stand further apart than words in one cluster. Kept exactly as drawn, since its length and kind may carry meaning; a part of the drafted types of prose to be confirmed."},"id":"01M6RBNRG36M5JPDTFQJ51FS87","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"mark":{"says":"The line as drawn.","shape":"string"}},"name":"break","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"One sentence, held as its words in order, so the words near each other are found near each other."},"id":"01M6RBNRG4R34AG4SQ6SSA4NEN","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"typedOrder":{"optional":true,"says":"How the words came when not in the order meant, as reversed.","shape":"string"},"words":{"holds":true,"says":"Its words, in the order meant, and the inline holons among them: links, emphasis, strong, code.","shape":{"list":"ref"}}},"name":"sentence","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"One word where it was said, a proposal beside the drafted Term, which is to be settled with it: its place is its locality, the sentence, paragraph and utterance holding it. What it shares with the same word elsewhere is its lexeme, which it only points at."},"id":"01M6RBNRG52GX2Y0ZF26E00E47","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"after":{"optional":true,"says":"Marks standing after the word, as a comma or full stop.","shape":"string"},"before":{"optional":true,"says":"Marks standing before the word, as an opening quote or bracket.","shape":"string"},"lexeme":{"holds":false,"says":"The word as one across every place it is said.","shape":"ref"},"text":{"says":"The word meant, without the marks around it; a run of marks alone is a word of its own.","shape":"string"},"typed":{"optional":true,"says":"The word as typed or heard, where it differs from what was meant.","shape":"string"}},"name":"word","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"A word as one, across every place it is said: the far relation, where the sentence is the near one. Its occurrences point at it; it holds none of them."},"id":"01M6RBNRG68RG7W8E7A7KQXXVK","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"text":{"says":"The word, in lower case.","shape":"string"}},"name":"lexeme","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"A possible evolution of glass, noted before it is weighed: what it opens, what unsettled decisions it rests on, and where it stands."},"id":"01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"from":{"holds":false,"says":"The utterances it was said in.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"opens":{"says":"What it makes possible.","shape":"string"},"restsOn":{"says":"The decisions not yet settled that it leans on: notes in words until those decisions are holons to point at.","shape":{"list":"string"}},"stands":{"says":"noted, weighed, chosen or let go.","shape":"string"},"title":{"says":"The path in a few words.","shape":"string"}},"name":"path","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"Lines drawn with characters, as the author draws them: kept whole and exactly, line by line, since their meaning is their shape and not their words."},"id":"01M6RBNRG8KNJ0E0QR5S9J77N1","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"lines":{"says":"The lines, in order, each as drawn.","shape":{"list":"string"}}},"name":"drawing","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"The whole that holds every lexeme, so the words as one stand in one place and not each at the field's top."},"id":"01M6RBNRG9HCWPWC850PY76KK1","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"lexemes":{"holds":true,"says":"The lexemes, as a set.","shape":{"set":"ref"}}},"name":"lexicon","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"A piece of knowledge under the rule, as a file of the wiki or a heading in it: its heading, its prose as blocks, and the briefs beneath it in order. The native form of what markdown held."},"id":"01M6SMW4015AT7Y2J8ADVARYVF","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"parts":{"holds":true,"says":"The briefs beneath it, in order.","shape":{"list":"ref"}},"path":{"optional":true,"says":"The file it was unpacked from, for the brief a file is.","shape":"string"},"prose":{"holds":true,"says":"Its blocks in order: paragraphs, lists, quotes, code, tables, drawings, and what stays closed.","shape":{"list":"ref"}},"title":{"says":"The heading's words, as written.","shape":"string"}},"name":"brief","prev":null}
