{"body":{"says":"Markdown's form of one holon of prose: the marks, numbers, routes and whitespace by which it is written as markdown and nothing else needs. It rests on the holon and points at it, in a branch of its own, so native prose stands clean and the files come back exactly."},"id":"01M6SVQV818R9508HM81T7Z6M3","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"above":{"optional":true,"says":"Whitespace above the heading of the brief a file is, where not one blank line.","shape":"string"},"fence":{"optional":true,"says":"The fence, as ``` or ~~~.","shape":"string"},"front":{"optional":true,"says":"The file's frontmatter, as pairs in order, for the brief a file is.","shape":{"list":"string"}},"gap":{"optional":true,"says":"The whitespace after the holon, where it is not the usual one: a single space between, nothing at the end; a blank line between blocks.","shape":"string"},"indent":{"optional":true,"says":"The spaces before its marker.","shape":"string"},"lead":{"optional":true,"says":"Whitespace between the heading and its prose, where not one blank line.","shape":"string"},"level":{"optional":true,"says":"How deep a brief's heading stands, as markdown's number of #; the brief's depth in its whole gives the same.","shape":"number"},"mark":{"optional":true,"says":"Its mark, where not *.","shape":"string"},"marker":{"optional":true,"says":"Its marker with the space after it, as - or 1. written.","shape":"string"},"number":{"optional":true,"says":"A brief's number as written before its title; its place in its whole's parts gives it for reading.","shape":"string"},"on":{"holds":false,"says":"The holon this is markdown's form of; it points, holding nothing.","shape":"ref"},"ticks":{"optional":true,"says":"Its backticks, as written.","shape":"string"},"title":{"optional":true,"says":"Its title, as written after the address.","shape":"string"},"to":{"optional":true,"says":"A link's route as written, where the link also leads by reference.","shape":"string"},"trail":{"optional":true,"says":"Whitespace after its prose, before what follows, where not the usual.","shape":"string"}},"name":"markdown","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"The whole holding markdown's forms of a branch of prose."},"id":"01M6SVQVSD08AY1EHZX614VDTT","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"forms":{"holds":true,"says":"The forms, as a set.","shape":{"set":"ref"}}},"name":"markdown-forms","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"A function, as field/types/function.json declares it, carried here until the field joins the union; the two are one type to be merged by id when it does."},"id":"01M6SDCDGQS54QF64WHWPH75Q5","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"from":{"optional":true,"says":"Where the holon was born from, as a path in the files it arrived from.","shape":"string"},"gives":{"optional":true,"says":"For a function of one's own, the expression it gives, each argument it was given named as { arg: i }.","shape":"expression"},"native":{"optional":true,"says":"For one of glass's own, the name the engine evaluates it by.","shape":"string"},"says":{"optional":true,"says":"What it gathers, in a sentence.","shape":"string"},"takes":{"optional":true,"says":"What it is given, each in turn: a set, any number of sets, words, a store's key, or an axis to group by; nothing unless it says.","shape":{"list":"string"}},"title":{"says":"What the function is called, as it is offered to be called.","shape":"string"}},"name":"function","prev":null}
